{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國商務部將新加坡人工智能公司Megaspeed列入貿易黑名單，同時英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳在特朗普政府支持下重新執掌公司。這一舉措旨在限制Megaspeed及其在馬來西亞和泰國的關聯實體與美國企業進行貿易，理由是這些實體可能將先進計算產品轉用於未經授權的最終用途或最終用户。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587868.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T19:44:25.382257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T19:22:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T19:37:36.758208+00:00","content_hash":"37ed668e3e27e5f417902cc7fa40998f74b119b3a5e5d8211e2d9320de86c1c8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}